Bugfix: Fix wrong count in the blob list summary of `prune` errors

When the repository index was incomplete, `restic prune` listed the missing
blobs with a "(N more)" summary whose count was too low by one, and even
showed an absurd "(0 more)" suffix when exactly ten blobs were missing.
Restic now reports the correct number of unlisted blobs, and shows no suffix
at all when all blobs fit into the list.

